    "The Flagship Studio is a small desktop app that writes your server to a USB stick. On your computer, go to flagshipserver.com/studio, install it, and open it to see the code to scan here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flagship Studio es una pequeña app de escritorio que graba tu servidor en una memoria USB. En tu ordenador, ve a flagshipserver.com/studio, instálala y ábrela para ver el código que debes escanear aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flagship Studio est une petite app de bureau qui écrit votre serveur sur une clé USB. Sur votre ordinateur, allez sur flagshipserver.com/studio, installez-la et ouvrez-la pour voir le code à scanner ici."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flagship Studio ist eine kleine Desktop-App, die deinen Server auf einen USB-Stick schreibt. Gehe auf deinem Computer zu flagshipserver.com/studio, installiere sie und öffne sie, um den Code zu sehen, den du hier scannst."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Flagship Studio é um pequeno app de desktop que grava o seu servidor em um pen drive. No seu computador, acesse flagshipserver.com/studio, instale-o e abra-o para ver o código a escanear aqui."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flagship Studio は、サーバーを USB メモリに書き込む小さなデスクトップアプリです。パソコンで flagshipserver.com/studio にアクセスしてインストールし、開くと、ここでスキャンするコードが表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flagship Studio 是一款小型桌面应用，可把你的服务器写入 U 盘。请在电脑上访问 flagshipserver.com/studio，安装并打开它，即可看到要在此扫描的代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't have the builder?": {
