            "value": "服务器没有确认批准。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't verify this approval. Ask them to open the invite again and resend.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo verificar esta aprobación. Pídeles que abran de nuevo la invitación y la reenvíen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de vérifier cette approbation. Demandez à la personne de rouvrir l’invitation et de renvoyer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Genehmigung konnte nicht überprüft werden. Bitte die Person, die Einladung erneut zu öffnen und noch einmal zu senden."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não foi possível verificar esta aprovação. Peça que abram o convite de novo e reenviem."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この承認を確認できませんでした。相手に招待をもう一度開いて再送してもらってください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证此批准。请让对方重新打开邀请并重新发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This invite is for a service that isn't on this server anymore.": {
